tps://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11736217?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/CreatedBySeb","html_url":"https://github.com/CreatedBySeb","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CreatedBySeb/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CreatedBySeb/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CreatedBySeb/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CreatedBySeb/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CreatedBySeb/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CreatedBySeb/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CreatedBySeb/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CreatedBySeb/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CreatedBySeb/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-07-17T20:32:26Z","updated_at":"2025-07-17T20:32:26Z","body":"Not able to replicate this on macOS with `v4.4.1.stable.official [49a5bc7b6]`, so it's possible it got fixed before the release. @mertkasar @SylvanFranklin can you confirm if you are still encountering this issue?\n\n```\nGodot v4.4.1.stable - macOS Sequoia (15.5.0) - Multi-window, 1 monitor - Metal (Forward+) - integrated Apple M1 (Apple7) - Apple M1 (8 threads)\n```","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3085383429/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3089246164","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/101486#issuecomment-3089246164","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101486","id":3089246164,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc64IifU","user":{"login":"mertkasar","id":2726562,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI3MjY1NjI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2726562?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mertkasar","html_url":"https://github.com/mertkasar","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mertkasar/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mertkasar/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mertkasar/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mertkasar/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mertkasar/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mertkasar/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mertkasar/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mertkasar/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mertkasar/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-07-18T11:58:39Z","updated_at":"2025-07-18T11:58:39Z","body":"I am still experiencing this issue in my project, across both v4.4.1-stable and v4.5-beta3. As a workaround, I am currently using a very low \"Low Processor Mode Sleep\" value in the editor settings.\n\nToday, I tested this on my Mac with a fresh user profile, a clean Godot install, and an empty project to rule out any interfering OS, engine, or project configurations. It appears the issue is not reproducible under these conditions.\n\nI am further investigating which specific configuration might cause this, as there are other issues related to mouse input.\n\nSee #104266","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3089246164/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3092460230","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/101486#issuecomment-3092460230","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101486","id":3092460230,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc64UzLG","user":{"login":"mertkasar","id":2726562,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI3MjY1NjI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2726562?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mertkasar","html_url":"https://github.com/mertkasar","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mertkasar/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mertkasar/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mertkasar/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mertkasar/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mertkasar/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mertkasar/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mertkasar/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mertkasar/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mertkasar/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-07-19T17:09:00Z","updated_at":"2025-07-19T17:09:00Z","body":"Well, today, I've introduced some key OS and Godot configurations to my fresh profile one by one, and I think I've found the cause.\n\nAt least for my setup, it was a paid window management app called [Magnet ](https://apps.apple.com/us/app/magnet/id441258766). Godot windows somehow got responsiveness issues when Magnet is running, especially with the mouse input. I've double-checked this on my main profile as well; removing Magnet solved all my responsiveness issues with Godot, including this one: #104266. I've replaced it with **Rectangle**, which doesn't seem to have the same issues.\n\nWe may close this issue since it's a third-party app, but it is still strange that it is only affecting Godot like that but no other app on my system. And it appears this affects not only the editor but also exported macOS builds.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3092460230/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":1},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3096149909","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/101486#issuecomment-3096149909","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101486","id":3096149909,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc64i3-V","user":{"login":"CreatedBySeb","id":11736217,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExNzM2MjE3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11736217?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/CreatedBySeb","html_url":"https://github.com/CreatedBySeb","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CreatedBySeb/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CreatedBySeb/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CreatedBySeb/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CreatedBySeb/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CreatedBySeb/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CreatedBySeb/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CreatedBySeb/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CreatedBySeb/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CreatedBySeb/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-07-21T10:40:54Z","updated_at":"2025-07-21T10:40:54Z","body":"I've tagged as third party now that it has been confirmed to happen with a specific third party application. The bug being related to a third party app doesn't mean it can't be investigated here, but it's not necessarily going to be prioritised compared to bugs with a broader effect.\n\nI imagine there is some issue with how it is hooking the windows that is interfering with Godot, though I am surprised it is only Godot that you've seen the issue with in that case. I would suggest also reaching out to the app developer if possible to ask them to investigate, since this behaviour isn't present with other similar software like Rectangle, so there must be a difference in handling.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3096149909/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3099769562","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/101486#issuecomment-3099769562","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101486","id":3099769562,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc64wrra","user":{"login":"Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou","html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-07-21T23:00:14Z","updated_at":"2025-07-21T23:00:14Z","body":"> Godot windows somehow got responsiveness issues when Magnet is running\n\nThis sounds similar to https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/103102 on Linux. Godot may be doing something wrong at the DisplayServer level that causes excessive OS API calls, not specific to X11.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3099769562/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3323231062","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/101486#issuecomment-3323231062","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101486","id":3323231062,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7GFHtW","user":{"login":"SNelson81","id":22567657,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyNTY3NjU3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22567657?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/SNelson81","html_url":"https://github.com/SNelson81","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SNelson81/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SNelson81/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SNelson81/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SNelson81/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SNelson81/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SNelson81/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SNelson81/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SNelson81/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SNelson81/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-09-23T09:56:07Z","updated_at":"2025-09-23T09:56:07Z","body":"Still happening on Godot 4.5 release version.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3323231062/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3323244032","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/101486#issuecomment-3323244032","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101486","id":3323244032,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7GFK4A","user":{"login":"SNelson81","id":22567657,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyNTY3NjU3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22567657?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/SNelson81","html_url":"https://github.com/SNelson81","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SNelson81/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SNelson81/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SNelson81/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SNelson81/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SNelson81/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SNelson81/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SNelson81/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SNelson81/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SNelson81/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-09-23T09:59:18Z","updated_at":"2025-09-23T09:59:18Z","body":"> Well, today, I've introduced some key OS and Godot configurations to my fresh profile one by one, and I think I've found the cause.\n> \n> At least for my setup, it was a paid window management app called [Magnet ](https://apps.apple.com/us/app/magnet/id441258766). Godot windows somehow got responsiveness issues when Magnet is running, especially with the mouse input. I've double-checked this on my main profile as well; removing Magnet solved all my responsiveness issues with Godot, including this one: [#104266](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/104266). I've replaced it with **Rectangle**, which doesn't seem to have the same issues.\n> \n> We may close this issue since it's a third-party app, but it is still strange that it is only affecting Godot like that but no other app on my system. And it appears this affects not only the editor but also exported macOS builds.\n\n\nHoly crap you may be on to something! I just disabled magnet and now my Godot window is responsive and it *seems* to have fixed the issue I had with delayed text selection. ","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3323244032/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3325716538","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/101486#issuecomment-3325716538","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101486","id":3325716538,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7GOmg6","user":{"login":"Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou","html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cali